guacamole-server
------------------------------------------
The guacamole-server package is a set of software which forms the basis of the
Guacamole stack. It consists of guacd, libguac, and several protocol support
libraries.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libavcodec63-9.0.2-3
  libavformat63-9.0.2-3
  libavutil61-9.0.2-3
  libcairo2-1.18.6-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgcrypt20-1.12.4-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libguac-terminal2-1.6.0-1bl1
  libguac25-1.6.0-1bl1
  libjpeg8-3.2.0-1
  libpango1.0_0-1.58.2-1
  libpng16-1.6.59-1
  libpulse0-17.0-4
  libssh2_1-1.11.0-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libswscale10-9.0.2-3
  libtelnet2-0.23-1bl3
  libuuid1-2.40.2-2
  libvncserver1-0.9.11-1
  libwebp7-1.6.0-1
  libwebsockets23-5.1.0-1bl1

