Canonical website:
  https://guacamole.apache.org/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/apache/guacamole-server/archive/refs/tags/1.6.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack guacamole-server-1.6.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./guacamole-server-1.6.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/guacamole-server-1.6.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/guacamole-server-1.6.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libguac25-1.6.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libguac-devel-1.6.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libguac-terminal2-1.6.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libguac-terminal-devel-1.6.0-X.tar.xz

